     "id": "CVE-2007-6750",
     "sourceIdentifier": "cve@mitre.org",
     "published": "2011-12-27T18:55:00.970",
     "lastModified": "2026-06-16T22:48:41.713",
     "vulnStatus": "Modified",
     "cveTags": [],
     "descriptions": [
      {
       "lang": "en",
       "value": "The Apache HTTP Server 1.x and 2.x allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (daemon outage) via partial HTTP requests, as demonstrated by Slowloris, related to the lack of the mod_reqtimeout module in versions before 2.2.15."
      },
      {
       "lang": "es",
       "value": "El servidor HTTP Apache 1.x y 2.x permite a atacantes remotos provocar una denegaci\u00f3n de servicio (ca\u00edda del demonio) a trav\u00e9s de una petici\u00f3n HTTP parcial, tal como se ha demostrado por Slowloris, relacionado con la falta del m\u00f3dulo mod_reqtimeout en versiones anteriores a 2.2.15."
      }
     ],
